      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁到处搜集东海帝王的资料，\n连以前已经看过的资料都不放过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ad0a439d2e3739fc1456e25dca83badc0f9cd1405938d1a695b59af6ef36ad",
