      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原本带着干劲在看纪录的美浦波旁，\n表情渐渐地黯淡下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5cddda33910c25e3f5b8a914f45b018dba575949075408dcd40b83e1c688d95",
